## 🚀 Key Takeaway

The Reorder List problem combines three important linked list techniques:

1. Slow and Fast Pointers to find the middle.
2. Pointer manipulation to reverse the second half.
3. Two-pointer merging to combine both halves alternately.

Understanding these three techniques makes several other linked list problems easier.

